# Firebase service account keys — used only by scripts/set-admin-claim.mjs and
# never by the frontend. Keep them outside the repo when you can; these patterns
# are the backstop for when you cannot. A committed key compromises the project.
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-admin-key*.json
.firebase/
